msgstr "以下培訓員負責編寫本主題的內容："

#. type: Title =
#: en/nodes/modules/ROOT/pages/communications-strategy.adoc:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Communications and stakeholder engagement"
msgstr "溝通與利害關係人參與"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/nodes/modules/ROOT/pages/communications-strategy.adoc:8
msgid "A communication and stakeholder engagement plan is valuable in organizing and maintaining positive visibility for your node. As with strategic plans, not all nodes will have communication and stakeholder engagement plans, but might be mentioned in their host institution's plans. Some nodes' host institutions may have communications teams that could help in crafting and delivering messages to engage their audiences. The GBIF communications strategy identifies key audiences, their information needs, and some key messages, which can be helpful for considering communications at the node level. We will use this document and some examples from nodes to practice designing communications approaches for key stakeholders during this module."
msgstr "溝通與利害關係人參與計畫，對於組織並維持您節點的正面能見度是重要的。如同策略計畫一樣，並非所有節點都會制定溝通與利害關係人參與計畫，但相關內容可能會在其主辦機構的計畫中有所提及。部分節點的主辦機構可能設有專責的溝通團隊，可協助擬定並傳達訊息，以吸引目標受眾的參與。 GBIF 的溝通策略識別關鍵受眾、其資訊需求以及其他關鍵訊息，這些內容對於在節點層級規劃溝通工作極具參考價值。在本單元中，我們將運用此文件及部分節點的實例，練習為關鍵利害關係人設計溝通策略。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/nodes/modules/ROOT/pages/communications-strategy.adoc:10
#: en/nodes/modules/ROOT/pages/developing-training.adoc:10
#: en/nodes/modules/ROOT/pages/resourcing-collaborative-projects.adoc:11
#: en/nodes/modules/ROOT/pages/strategic-planning.adoc:10
msgid "These materials were developed as part of the 2019 Global Nodes training in Leiden, Netherlands."
msgstr "這些教材是作為 2019 年在荷蘭萊頓舉行的「全球節點」培訓活動的一部分而開發的。"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/nodes/modules/ROOT/pages/communications-strategy.adoc:19
msgid "Describe the different types of audiences that GBIF needs to engage on the global level"
msgstr "請說明 GBIF 需要在全球層面與哪些不同類型的受眾建立聯繫"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/nodes/modules/ROOT/pages/communications-strategy.adoc:20
msgid "Understand that in developing a communication strategy, you need to adapt key messages to the specific audience you are engaging and select the appropriate medium"
msgstr "需理解，在制定溝通策略時，您需要根據所針對的特定受眾調整關鍵訊息，並選擇合適的傳播媒介"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/nodes/modules/ROOT/pages/communications-strategy.adoc:21
msgid "Describe different communication means (media) that nodes can use to engage their network"
msgstr "請說明節點可用於與其網路進行互動的各種溝通方式（媒介）"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/nodes/modules/ROOT/pages/communications-strategy.adoc:22
msgid "Adapt messages and media to different audiences"
msgstr "根據不同受眾調整訊息與媒體內容"

#. type: delimited block =
#: en/nodes/modules/ROOT/pages/communications-strategy.adoc:23
msgid "Develop communication strategies tailored to specific audiences"
msgstr "針對特定受眾所制定的溝通策略"

